## MCP server config files (non-.local — committed when token-free)
# These are AI tool config files that declare MCP servers. The .local
# variants (which carry tokens) are in dev-local.ignorefile. The non-.local
# variants are committed when they contain no secrets — they're shared AI
# guidance config, not per-developer state. AI indexing tools should still
# ignore them to avoid indexing config boilerplate.
.mcp.json
.cursor/mcp.json
.vscode/mcp.json
.zed/settings.json
.devin/config.json

